{'symbol': 'PARA', 'date': '2022-04-05 16:15:00', 'title': 'PARAMOUNT GLOBAL DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , APRIL 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PARAMOUNT GLOBAL (NASDAQ: PARA; PARAA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.24\xa0PER SHARE ON BOTH ITS CLASS A AND CLASS B COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON\xa0JULY 1, 2022\xa0TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 15, 2022.'}